  "base": "4cca88da8",
  "shipping": "FrameBuffer checks the existing small-block rejection bound before equality of full thumbnail arrays. During overflow each surviving candidate remembers the newest immutable later thumbnail already ruled out. Replacement thumbnails have new sequence IDs. Regular source WGC cadence stays at 100 ms.",
  "method": "Windows source replay 2052x1128, warmed FP32 iGPU, changed floor with its visible node labels or two newly clickable held items. Independent 16 ms WGC observes actual assistant pixels registered against a correct settled reference (registration error <0.015; negative pre-switch crops checked). Private local state digest checked on each run. One measured transition of each kind per process. This is a replay of two transitions, not a game-session latency distribution.",
